    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰδ-άνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to swell,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλος . . οἰδάνει ἐν στήθεσσι νόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.554
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθυ κῆρ οἰδάνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.478
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be swollen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰδάνεται κραδίη χόλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.646
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰδέω</span>
			, intr., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φήληξ οἰδάνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1165
				</span></i>
			.</div>
